SJHzuFgcjYQAtSyHpQH0EYVi6kFaZUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6KwApfLZbES8C-0GquXoeyX75Y2eZaUl-23PA6vGhlYw&oe=6A0B18B2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DsWIs4bQJUMQ7kNvwE_i-wu&_nc_oc=AdoT8_mNF5PihyIvCqMMRHRRwnm7fuQ5JONdBqs4cpeEky-TScYInMXNILAdAqo8eBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4BbXk2djSbXHByPWN_iA7mkQxWDuK50U4a24aZXxY6Lg&oe=6A0B05D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CBJIePVKfTsQ7kNvwHuiVd6&_nc_oc=AdoxWfEAhLV970svGhNU8LjqZRqkfCi_Nyh1C1yVc6oBfMDoZqZ1PQbNhwtZhKmwPIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Sijp-d3rt6pU6iBQofkhbB3pOk6OiY96afo1AdImMow&oe=6A0B0B15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-rD-mvMiANgQ7kNvwE2_Qmm&_nc_oc=Adq9IADRuSCJM_cT4XVWyV1jbODa43zW2AznqiMRIznTMBx4Ty3b5_e3KlZJpy5GlU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xdqO_qYgEKDKCoK_K9r67e2aZSOOhlzA967YaAry94g&oe=6A0B1EC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lhw0ySlFyo8Q7kNvwHZibnK&_nc_oc=AdqlcPg8sZ6wVdY-HRcl-S3FFMAFUZZCHCeLi0h47lB9s1igxSd2v10cLErb0uc-CM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5KsUHd8LFSQuFhKazGyIEZsKaaUZ_frvagDvOOZLIetQ&oe=6A0B0544"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DUM5UIy52ZUQ7kNvwG01Fsb&_nc_oc=AdpksT7FLY95s1dYqwL71hJw6bEY49sLVOnJkHgqN448FMjDwIjNIa07_xn5Vpc